Built on SIPp
-------------
This project is a web front end and orchestration layer for SIPp
(https://github.com/SIPp/sipp), the free open-source SIP test tool and traffic
generator. SIPp does all of the actual SIP call generation here, and the credit
for that belongs to the SIPp authors and community. SIPp is licensed under the
GNU General Public License, version 3 or later, Copyright (C) 2003-2026 The
SIPp Authors. SIPp is NOT included in this repository and is not distributed
with it. You install it separately, and this project runs it as an external
program (the two are separate programs that communicate through command-line
arguments, files and standard process control).

This project is independent. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or
sponsored by the SIPp project.

